{
 "_comment": "Module map for tools/check_modules.py. 'modules' = the module layout (paths are globs from the repo root; first match wins, so ui-common precedes ui). enforceNamespace: every file of the module must open namespace <namespace> (foundation/domain live in plain `tanara`). tests/** and third_party/** are not checked.",
